  "goodToKnow": "Rundum means all round or completely, mostly before adjectives: rundum zufrieden, rundum glücklich, ein rundum gelungenes Fest. Das Rundum-sorglos-Paket (the all-round carefree package) is an all-inclusive offer, used in ads and ironically. Rundherum means all around in space: rundherum Wald. Rund also means about: rund 100 Leute (about 100 people), very common in news."
